        "created_at": "2013-04-28T17:11:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Moonfall Day Day... see you there... underlings... tumbling</p><p>Want to sneer... evil glare... here I go... bumbling</p><p>But with my Death Ray I wil end... all life</p><p>It's not a Freeze ray or an Ice Beam, that's so Ryan Frost</p><p>I just want to find the might... to find the strength... so all hope's lost</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>He also has a rousing number about how he's better - better than Paul.</p><p>Ironic</p>",
